    not signed up. The operator's words, 17 Sep 2026: *"or even on the homepage
    as kind of pre-sales documentation. For someone coming to the page cold.
    I could be something like prospektor.ai/learn"*. The words are the mails'
    own (`data/lessons.json`, out of the studio's `public/lessons.js`), drawn
